<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/veryhot_post.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!! &nbsp;(Read 1034 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1046" title="View the profile of Dose">Dose</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 5<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img44.exs.cx/img44/6244/ava4sj.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Pwner of Grass_Snake_01<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1046"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg15193#msg15193"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg15193#msg15193">Re: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #45 on:</b> March 04, 2005, 09:08:28 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							While the augs are a quite nice addition, they could have easily been added to LDoN camps. LDoN has joined LoY in the expansion graveyard for the most part. They are great xp for those leveling up from 20-60 (about 2% of the server population), but really offer nothing to those that have been there, and done that. <br /><br />Still no guild tribute master in the guild hall (why not?!). The missions and tasks are nice, but forces people to choose good vs. evil. If I played on a PvP or roleplaying server, I would be much more excited about factioning up to Firiona Vie. The nicest features about DoN are expansion-bait, and imo did not require their own expansion. <br /><br />The rate of expansion releases is giving most more things to do than there is time for. While options are good, it is difficult to work on GoD or OoW quests when everyone is working on DoN. I&#039;d welcome a merge with another server at this point, to at least increase the odds of finding others that are working on the same expansion as myself.<br /><br />I&#039;ll bump my former rating up to a 7 out of 10, for the new augs &amp; such, but overall, still a thin expansion for $29.<br /><br />I think SOE knows most players will buy any piece of shit expansion they put out as long as they add something everyone wants. One expansion per year is plenty for my entertainment, but I hear there&#039;ll be another out this year for a grand total of 3 in 12 months time. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bitching.gif" alt="Bitching" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=839285&amp;resize=true" target="_blank"><img src="http://img153.exs.cx/img153/8960/signi5pd.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg15195"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1" title="View the profile of Kinladar">Kinladar</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Ranger Bait<br />
								Administrator<br />
								Veeshan<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 14504<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/macross.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								My Avatar can beat up your avatar!<br />
								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/kinladar@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="kinladar@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org" title="http://www.rodcetnife.org" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:truman@thewavz.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg15195#msg15195"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1425.msg15195#msg15195">Re: DON EXPANSION What a waste!!!!!!!!!</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #46 on:</b> March 04, 2005, 09:30:38 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							The return on investment per expansion is just poor now. I never minded waiting a year for a new expansion, and I think this 4-6 month time table they have for each new expansion is part of the reason that balance is so screwy. Not enough time taken to measure it.<br /><br />Some things need to be acted upon quickly, pushing out expansions for the sake of pushing out expansions does not.<br /><br />I actually think expansions are thier primary source of income now that they have so many merged subscription plans. Look at it this way, for ages, each player paid 12 bucks a month for the game. Recently they have been pushing these all access passes, to get people to play more games, but at a steep discount when you would add up each individual subscription rate.<br /><br />So you can play SWG, EQ2, and EQ now all with one access pass. What would have been in the past a total incoming of 36 dollars, is now 22, split 3 ways = $7.33, and this does not account for the other games in that, like planetside etc...<br /><br />So for the sake of argument, and to account for the 3 other games in an all access pass, EQ for a subscription rate return from said pass is only about 5-6 bucks. Half or less than half of what used to come in for server support costs etc...<br /><br />There&#039;s no profit there, and I would hazard a guess that they are loosing money on just subscriptions at that stage. This would be a clear reason why they need to push out an expansion every six months, and push Adventure Packs in EQ2, etc...<br /><br />The subscription rates are simply not profitable, and to make profits, they need to do it through addons/expansions. But this devalues the worth of exapansions, since you can only add so much to the game etc... <br /><br />It also means that resources that should be devoted to class balance, and other aspects takes a back seat to assuring profit returns for the company.<br /><br />Granted, there&#039;s alot of theorizing in my post here, but alot makes sense in the grand scheme of things.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.wowrankings.com/viewb.htm?name=Kinladar&amp;s_id=38" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/sig-kinladar-wow.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><a href="http://www.chaoticdiscord.org" target="_blank">Chaotic Discord</a> found in {World of Warcraft}<br />Guild Leader of Fires of Time (Retired)
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
